{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-2681233","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【日记】2016日本食与明日叶啤酒","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"记录日本海鲜与八丈岛辣椒酱油，还尝试用威士忌调制明日叶啤酒，分享美食与意外发现。","date":"2016-04-10","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 日本食（Japanese food）","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 日本食（Japanese food）","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2681233.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160415015602id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2681233.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","食べもの飲みもの"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":448,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-2681233/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/001-8a1176e65c.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[1080,666],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"记录日本海鲜与八丈岛辣椒酱油，还尝试用威士忌调制明日叶啤酒，分享美食与意外发现。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">日本料理！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/001-8a1176e65c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/001-8a1176e65c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"666\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大家知道这是什么吗？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n从左上开始往右\n\n<br>\n\n\n醋拌海参\n萤乌贼\n蛤蜊\n\n<br>\n\n\n下面一排从左边开始\n\n<br>\n\n\n北海道斑节虾\n明石章鱼\n还有紫萁嫩芽！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n哎呀——\n每一样都好好吃！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n        不管怎么说，\n    \n和日本酒的搭配简直绝佳！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n我又发现了一个东西！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n八丈岛的\n岛椒酱油……\n不管蘸什么都超级好吃！\n八丈岛的辣椒酱油！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/002-b2aa6cda16.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/002-b2aa6cda16.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这也太\n好吃了！\n配海苔也好，生鱼片也好，\n配紫萁嫩芽也好！太合适了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n前几天\n有位专业人士看了\n我写明日叶啤酒的博客后，\n给了我一些建议！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n据说！\n用威士忌之类的酒\n把明日叶粉末溶开会比较好！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n那当然\n得试试看吧！\n毕竟我是增田会长嘛（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/003-403ee807ac.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/003-403ee807ac.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n            往这个里面……\n\n<br>\n\n\n混进去试试看！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/004-143a139639.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/004-143a139639.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n哇——！\n浓浓的明日叶调好了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n我来试着倒点啤酒进去！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/005-bc45ca8d43.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/005-bc45ca8d43.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"682\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n泡沫虽然\n有一定程度，\n但看起来应该没问题！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/006-9d717b3672.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/006-9d717b3672.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这是加入威士忌的啤酒，\n明日叶和酒精\n都感觉很浓，\n完成！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这也太\n浓郁好喝了！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        多亏别人教了我，\n    又能\n    进一步进化了！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n能有这样的\n连接，\n真的很感谢！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n        感觉真是特别棒～！\n\n<br>\n\n\n好吃！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/007-5167adf491.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/007-5167adf491.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">日本食！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/001-8a1176e65c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/001-8a1176e65c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"666\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nみなさん\n何だか分かりますか？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n左上から右に\n\n<br>\n\n\nナマコ酢\nホタルイカ\nアサリ\n\n<br>\n\n\n下の段の左から\n\n<br>\n\n\n北海道のシマエビ\n明石のタコ\nそして こごみ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいやー\nどれも美味しかったです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        何と言っても\n    \n日本酒との相性抜群！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\nもうひとつ発見！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n八丈島の\n島とう醤油・・\n何を付けても激ウマ！\n八丈島の唐辛子醤油！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/002-b2aa6cda16.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/002-b2aa6cda16.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこりゃ\n美味いです！\n海苔にも刺身にも\nこごみにも合う！合う！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n先日の\n明日葉ビールのブログを見て\nプロの方から\nアドバイス\nいただきました！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nなんと！\nウイスキーなどで\n明日葉の粉を溶かすと良いとのこと！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそりゃ\nやってみるでしょ！\nマスダ\n会長ですから（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/003-403ee807ac.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/003-403ee807ac.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n            これに・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n混ぜてみます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/004-143a139639.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/004-143a139639.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nうおー！\n濃い明日葉出来た！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nビール入れてみるよ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/005-bc45ca8d43.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/005-bc45ca8d43.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"682\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nあわあわは\nある程度あるけど\n大丈夫そう！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/006-9d717b3672.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/006-9d717b3672.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nウイスキー入りビールですが\n明日葉もアルコールも\n濃い感じで\n完成！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこりゃ\n濃くて美味しいぞ！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        教えてもらって\nまたひとつ\n進化できました！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこういう\nつながり\nありがたいです！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        何だかとってもいい感じ〜！\n\n<br>\n\n\n美味しい！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/007-5167adf491.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2681233/007-5167adf491.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}